From 27bb4b7188f441db35e3bd5caf57e3efe602d6ce Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: pixbroker <324802287+pixbroker@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Fri, 4 Sep 2026 09:04:37 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 3/3] Take the Omarchy state, file read and watch from the
 omarchy-theme crate.

theme/omarchy.rs keeps what is Grok-specific: the slot table, the overlay
and the render-cache generation. Locating ~/.local/state/omarchy/current,
reading the rendered grok.toml and the swap-tolerant inotify watch now come
from the omarchy-theme crate on crates.io (tokio feature), the same crate
the other Omarchy-following apps use. The direct notify dependency goes
back to upstream's optional line.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>
